1
00:00:03,464 --> 00:00:06,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>长州派维新志士绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:07,472 --> 00:00:10,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>活跃在14岁到19岁的五年间</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:15,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>前期作为刽子手
是暗中活动的无情暗杀者</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:15,947 --> 00:00:17,365
<c.simplifiedchinese>后期</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:17,450 --> 00:00:21,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为游击剑客
保护盟友免受幕府剑客集团的伤害</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:26,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>你现在出名是因为后期的活动吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:28,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:28,597 --> 00:00:34,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了吧 要是让真正的拔刀斋留下
那不就前功尽弃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:34,609 --> 00:00:38,738
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是叫你作为拔刀斋留下
而是作为浪客留…</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:40,663 --> 00:00:43,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 我明白了 想走就走吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:44,129 --> 00:00:47,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>但至少离开前告诉我你的名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:48,554 --> 00:00:52,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是说 你不想告诉我你的真名？</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:56,027 --> 00:00:56,861
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:59,367 --> 00:01:00,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:01,747 --> 00:01:04,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是在下现在的名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:05,045 --> 00:01:06,046
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:06,131 --> 00:01:09,009
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道何时又会去何处流浪</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:09,094 --> 00:01:13,682
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你不介意这点
在下愿意暂时留下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:22,705 --> 00:01:25,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>哇 这茶好香啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:25,628 --> 00:01:26,962
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:27,047 --> 00:01:29,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>我特意去买了上好的茶叶</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:30,053 --> 00:01:32,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 真的很好喝</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:32,433 --> 00:01:36,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到小姑娘你这么喜欢好吃的</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:36,608 --> 00:01:38,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>她就是个吃货</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:38,779 --> 00:01:41,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过多亏了这点
我们能吃到些好东西</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:41,827 --> 00:01:44,121
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这么想的话就该感谢我</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:01:44,207 --> 00:01:46,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们真的很感谢你</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:01:49,133 --> 00:01:53,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么美味的茶 有多少年没喝到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:01:53,350 --> 00:01:55,686
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这么夸张 阿剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:01:55,771 --> 00:01:58,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你到处流浪 茶总该有空喝吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:01:59,027 --> 00:02:00,279
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:02:00,364 --> 00:02:05,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为一直在路上
没空好好坐下来品茶</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:02:05,123 --> 00:02:10,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 偶尔也讲讲你旅途中的事吧
有没有什么稀奇的故事发生啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:02:10,593 --> 00:02:12,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 好主意</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:02:12,472 --> 00:02:14,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想听你旅途中有意思的故事</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:02:14,851 --> 00:02:17,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想听你打败恶人的故事</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:02:19,527 --> 00:02:20,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说大家</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:02:20,654 --> 00:02:22,698
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心很为难</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:02:22,784 --> 00:02:26,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>-别逼他了
-让在下想想</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:02:26,333 --> 00:02:32,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个稀奇、有趣、打败恶人的故事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:02:40,109 --> 00:02:43,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:13,421 --> 00:04:17,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨 外国人居留地</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:17,262 --> 00:04:21,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时期
根据与各国签订的友好通商条约</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:21,479 --> 00:04:24,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨港开港时</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:26,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>被指定为外国人居留</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:26,614 --> 00:04:31,286
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及交易的场所
成为了一片特殊的区域</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:31,958 --> 00:04:33,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>让一让！</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:34,004 --> 00:04:36,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>-哦啰？
-我有急事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:36,216 --> 00:04:38,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>让一让！</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:40,308 --> 00:04:42,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了！你没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:44,024 --> 00:04:45,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>发生什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:46,361 --> 00:04:49,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢天谢地 你没事太好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:49,326 --> 00:04:51,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为你被撞了</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:51,998 --> 00:04:56,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 在你看来在下没事 那就好</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:57,008 --> 00:04:58,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:58,762 --> 00:05:02,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是车夫男吉 你是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:02,102 --> 00:05:03,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:04,565 --> 00:05:08,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>-浪客…
-就是漫无目的流浪的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:08,239 --> 00:05:10,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…也就是说…</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:10,953 --> 00:05:12,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:12,665 --> 00:05:15,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>-那是刀！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:15,671 --> 00:05:17,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这不是违反废刀令吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:17,633 --> 00:05:22,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>这的确是刀 不过这把刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:22,142 --> 00:05:24,727
<c.simplifiedchinese>这边 车夫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:24,814 --> 00:05:27,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>-对啊 我得走了！
-哦啰啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:30,575 --> 00:05:34,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>-突然病倒在街上啊
-快点把她送去看大夫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:34,332 --> 00:05:37,043
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道治疗一刻都不能耽误</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:37,130 --> 00:05:39,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我用宝贝车子把他带来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:39,677 --> 00:05:41,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>医生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:44,896 --> 00:05:46,147
<c.simplifiedchinese>好可疑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:46,231 --> 00:05:47,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>不用担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:48,068 --> 00:05:50,613
<c.simplifiedchinese>我并不可疑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:53,162 --> 00:05:56,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国人…而且带着面具</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:56,126 --> 00:05:58,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>这都不觉得可疑</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:58,464 --> 00:06:01,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨真是了不起的城市啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:01,386 --> 00:06:03,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有啊没有！</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:03,098 --> 00:06:04,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>哟 男吉</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:04,685 --> 00:06:06,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>-这个医生可信吗？
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:07,023 --> 00:06:10,193
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国人在这的确不稀奇 不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:13,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个不肯露脸 不知底细的医生
真的能信任他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:13,954 --> 00:06:15,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这说的什么话？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:15,791 --> 00:06:18,418
<c.simplifiedchinese>在江户生活三代才算是江户人</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:18,504 --> 00:06:21,423
<c.simplifiedchinese>但在横滨住上三天就算是横滨人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:23,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>-确实…
-就算你这么说 可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:23,890 --> 00:06:27,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生在横滨可不止三天啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:27,522 --> 00:06:30,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们难道不相信身为横滨人的他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:30,277 --> 00:06:31,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:31,655 --> 00:06:35,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们相信你 男吉 但外国人还是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:35,496 --> 00:06:37,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们可是横滨人</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:37,583 --> 00:06:39,627
<c.simplifiedchinese>走在文明开化的最前端啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:39,713 --> 00:06:42,007
<c.simplifiedchinese>妈妈！</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:42,845 --> 00:06:46,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>你妈妈会没事的
埃尔德医生可是世界闻名的名医</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:46,268 --> 00:06:49,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论是伤者还是病人
他都会帮助他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:55,745 --> 00:06:58,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>-男吉
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:58,208 --> 00:07:00,252
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要开药</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:00,337 --> 00:07:04,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>请把这位女士带到我在酒店的房间里</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:04,262 --> 00:07:06,056
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到了！这就去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:06,141 --> 00:07:08,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>挡路的让开！</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:08,228 --> 00:07:09,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>搞什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:10,566 --> 00:07:11,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:11,693 --> 00:07:13,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>石津泥庵！</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:13,655 --> 00:07:17,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>听到骚动声我就来看看 又是你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:17,663 --> 00:07:21,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>来历不明的流浪西医</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:21,129 --> 00:07:27,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>你让我很为难啊
竟敢在我的地盘擅自医治别人</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么叫擅自！</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:28,895 --> 00:07:32,148
<c.simplifiedchinese>你只肯治有势力的洋人和有钱人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:32,235 --> 00:07:36,322
<c.simplifiedchinese>那怎么了？付不起诊费者不能活</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:36,410 --> 00:07:39,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们做的对你有什么影响！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:39,457 --> 00:07:41,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生在救治付不起诊费的人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:42,046 --> 00:07:44,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这点让我为难啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:45,511 --> 00:07:49,723
<c.simplifiedchinese>医疗本来就是价格昂贵的技术</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:49,811 --> 00:07:51,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>西医的价格</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:51,606 --> 00:07:55,110
<c.simplifiedchinese>自从明治时期传来后一直水涨船高</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:07:55,866 --> 00:08:00,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果放任别人进行免费医疗</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:00,666 --> 00:08:04,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>就会让西医贬价</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:05,676 --> 00:08:08,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>别给她看病</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:12,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>-否则…
-你就要对付我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:12,273 --> 00:08:13,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>别说蠢话</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:13,609 --> 00:08:17,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>对居留地的外国人出手是最大的禁忌</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:17,951 --> 00:08:21,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要对付的是那个倒在路上的女人</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:21,416 --> 00:08:25,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果患者病入膏肓
你也没法再救治她了</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:25,341 --> 00:08:26,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>妈妈！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:30,392 --> 00:08:31,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们都别说了</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:32,396 --> 00:08:35,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在给这位夫人治病才最要紧</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:35,361 --> 00:08:37,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>你少插手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:37,907 --> 00:08:41,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则我用这个把你的眼睛挖出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:41,164 --> 00:08:43,959
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:44,045 --> 00:08:46,631
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你这不是违反废刀令吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:46,716 --> 00:08:48,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也有资格说别人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:48,136 --> 00:08:51,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>在明治时代的横滨
还准备摆武士架子吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:52,395 --> 00:08:53,312
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞起来了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:08:57,321 --> 00:08:59,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>还敢乱动！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:03,125 --> 00:09:05,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 我们等你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:05,296 --> 00:09:07,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>女孩和妈妈就交给我</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:08,385 --> 00:09:11,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你这家伙！
-埃尔德先生 快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:12,977 --> 00:09:15,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>戴着面具 来历不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:15,733 --> 00:09:17,151
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的是医生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:17,236 --> 00:09:20,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>-最好不要牵扯进去
-是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:22,163 --> 00:09:23,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着保镖吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:24,459 --> 00:09:29,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 这样的话我有一计</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:29,302 --> 00:09:31,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>查出他的住处</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:31,514 --> 00:09:34,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我有口信给他
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:45,084 --> 00:09:47,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在酒店又多订了一间房</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:47,922 --> 00:09:51,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>在病情好转前 她最好安心静养</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:51,096 --> 00:09:53,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来药开始起效了</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:54,059 --> 00:09:56,937
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果烧退了 她就会好起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:57,023 --> 00:09:59,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国大夫 谢谢你</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:59,112 --> 00:10:01,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>不客气</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:02,410 --> 00:10:04,578
<c.simplifiedchinese>他医治这么尽心尽力啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:04,664 --> 00:10:07,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>在我腿断了的时候 他也是一样用心</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:07,420 --> 00:10:10,047
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为知道我病着没法拉车赚钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:10,134 --> 00:10:12,678
<c.simplifiedchinese>他无论如何都不肯接受诊费</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:12,763 --> 00:10:16,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此 在我好转后
他还雇佣我让我赚钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:17,606 --> 00:10:19,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不收无力负担的人一分一毫</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:20,069 --> 00:10:22,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽力帮助有需要的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:22,867 --> 00:10:24,785
<c.simplifiedchinese>他就是这种人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:24,871 --> 00:10:28,624
<c.simplifiedchinese>-多谢你啊 男吉
-不…</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:28,712 --> 00:10:32,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才应该谢谢你啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:32,678 --> 00:10:34,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 要搭车吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:34,599 --> 00:10:37,101
<c.simplifiedchinese>“绝不收无力负担的人一分一毫</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:37,188 --> 00:10:38,939
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽力帮助有需要的人…”</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:39,024 --> 00:10:40,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>不付车费的直接送到警局</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:43,283 --> 00:10:46,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是浪客 走路就可以了</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:46,748 --> 00:10:49,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 这样更像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:49,504 --> 00:10:52,965
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客先生也帮了大忙</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:53,637 --> 00:10:56,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为回礼 要喝点茶吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:56,099 --> 00:10:58,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>-下午茶
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:58,396 --> 00:11:00,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>男吉 也一起来吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:00,901 --> 00:11:04,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然 虽然不知道那是什么
但我很乐意一起！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:06,161 --> 00:11:09,748
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天天气很好 就在户外喝茶吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:09,836 --> 00:11:11,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>好主意</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:11,171 --> 00:11:13,632
<c.simplifiedchinese>在户外喝茶吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:16,683 --> 00:11:17,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>请</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:19,647 --> 00:11:20,856
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:25,074 --> 00:11:26,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:27,413 --> 00:11:30,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下我来日本值了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:33,048 --> 00:11:34,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>西洋剑？</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:42,443 --> 00:11:44,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>好漂亮的花园</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:44,822 --> 00:11:48,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>瑞香花散发着清香 春天来了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:49,247 --> 00:11:51,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>请用吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:51,251 --> 00:11:55,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么让我们为遇到浪客干杯！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:55,677 --> 00:11:57,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>用红茶干杯吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:57,640 --> 00:12:00,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要在意这种小事</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:06,070
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是西洋茶和点心啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:06,156 --> 00:12:08,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不客气了</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:13,505 --> 00:12:14,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>好喝</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:15,634 --> 00:12:19,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客 你也别客气了 快吃吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:31,624 --> 00:12:33,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>味道不错吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:35,256 --> 00:12:37,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>点心清甜好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:37,636 --> 00:12:39,638
<c.simplifiedchinese>红茶味道如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:39,724 --> 00:12:42,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>用的是很好的茶叶</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:42,604 --> 00:12:45,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢你请在下品茶</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:46,696 --> 00:12:50,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道你无法品尝红茶的味道吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:52,583 --> 00:12:54,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实说 是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:58,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 看来你有点累了</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:58,428 --> 00:13:01,556
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟他跟那群家伙折腾了半天</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:02,226 --> 00:13:06,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下并没有感到疲累啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:06,318 --> 00:13:09,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是只有身体会累的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:10,577 --> 00:13:15,123
<c.simplifiedchinese>能闻到花香却品不到茶香</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:15,211 --> 00:13:17,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是你的心累了</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:18,593 --> 00:13:19,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:20,514 --> 00:13:24,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>外国的医生说的话真是有意思啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:25,482 --> 00:13:28,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你其实是很有名的武士吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:28,738 --> 00:13:30,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个嘛…</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:30,951 --> 00:13:33,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时期一定很活跃吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:34,082 --> 00:13:37,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道了 你是那个！新选组吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:38,967 --> 00:13:41,135
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:41,973 --> 00:13:47,061
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的京都形势险恶
但横滨也是够呛啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:47,651 --> 00:13:51,738
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟突然就成了外国人居留地啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:52,326 --> 00:13:55,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨真的变成了一个有趣的城市</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:55,374 --> 00:13:59,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>说起文明开化的程度
不输给东京和函馆</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:00,342 --> 00:14:04,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨一定有很多外国来的稀罕物</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:04,142 --> 00:14:07,729
<c.simplifiedchinese>和新技术制造的产品吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:07,816 --> 00:14:08,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:09,068 --> 00:14:12,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨真的是个好地方 我超喜欢</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:12,491 --> 00:14:17,663
<c.simplifiedchinese>有好几个推荐的景点
要不要我用车拉着你转转？</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:17,753 --> 00:14:20,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧 在下身上没钱</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:20,926 --> 00:14:22,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 我忘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:23,556 --> 00:14:25,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>那这样如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:25,727 --> 00:14:27,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>你拉着我</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:27,773 --> 00:14:30,734
<c.simplifiedchinese>我坐在车上 给你介绍各个地方</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:30,820 --> 00:14:32,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你就不用付车费了</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:32,824 --> 00:14:34,785
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是个有趣的主意</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:36,248 --> 00:14:38,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>那埃尔德医生也一起来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:38,795 --> 00:14:40,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也一起？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:40,547 --> 00:14:42,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>车上只能坐一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:42,886 --> 00:14:45,222
<c.simplifiedchinese>三个人一起还多出一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:45,307 --> 00:14:47,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就石头剪子布决定</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:47,520 --> 00:14:49,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>最先输的人负责拉车</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:49,942 --> 00:14:53,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>赢家坐车 剩下的那个就跟着车跑</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:54,075 --> 00:14:57,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是你输了怎么办 男吉？</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:57,916 --> 00:15:00,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想那么多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:01,381 --> 00:15:02,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>石头剪子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:02,884 --> 00:15:04,678
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:04,763 --> 00:15:06,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>石头剪子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:06,224 --> 00:15:08,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:08,103 --> 00:15:09,271
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:09,355 --> 00:15:11,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:11,109 --> 00:15:13,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>-布！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:13,990 --> 00:15:16,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们这么有默契啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:16,202 --> 00:15:19,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个概率 简直是奇迹</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:19,918 --> 00:15:21,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:21,629 --> 00:15:25,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这样没解决问题啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:25,095 --> 00:15:29,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就抽签吧
不管抽到什么都不准抱怨</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:34,197 --> 00:15:36,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来拉车！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:36,368 --> 00:15:38,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下坐车</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:38,330 --> 00:15:40,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 出发吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:49,895 --> 00:15:53,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨居留地39号</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:53,443 --> 00:15:55,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>致力于在日本普及医疗</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:55,322 --> 00:16:00,369
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及翻译《圣经》的美国传教士赫本</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:00,457 --> 00:16:03,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>在此处建立了赫本学校</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:04,549 --> 00:16:06,509
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个时代的横滨港</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:06,594 --> 00:16:11,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>水深不足以容纳大型船只靠岸</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:11,104 --> 00:16:16,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此使用名为“驳船”的小船
在码头间运送货物</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:16,281 --> 00:16:21,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了防止海浪而建成的曲线形码头
被称为大象的鼻子</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:25,842 --> 00:16:27,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>横滨站</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:28,138 --> 00:16:31,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治五年 在新桥和横滨之间</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:31,227 --> 00:16:36,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>作为文明开化的象征
开通了日本第一条铁路</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:36,906 --> 00:16:42,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>该车站由美国建筑师布里奇斯设计</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:42,208 --> 00:16:45,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>广受好评 甚至被画在浮世绘上</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:54,315 --> 00:16:57,443
<c.simplifiedchinese>在横滨观光的感想如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:57,530 --> 00:17:00,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下感觉到了新时代风貌
是很好的城市啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:00,954 --> 00:17:02,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:02,581 --> 00:17:04,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在你明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:04,126 --> 00:17:06,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>在横滨住三天就算是横滨人了</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:06,172 --> 00:17:09,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再做浪客了 干脆做横滨人吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:09,804 --> 00:17:11,305
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:13,186 --> 00:17:16,022
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我就先回去了 再见</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:24,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真的可以吗？
-没关系的</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:24,125 --> 00:17:26,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个时间也找不到住处了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:31,889 --> 00:17:34,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>-请
-多谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:35,230 --> 00:17:38,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>进了室内也会脱鞋啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:39,447 --> 00:17:42,658
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好像突然变矮了 埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:42,745 --> 00:17:47,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是你的错觉
外国人在室内看起来会更矮</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:47,421 --> 00:17:49,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有这种事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:49,884 --> 00:17:52,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>-好奇怪啊
-我去换衣服了</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:52,806 --> 00:17:55,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>先去卧室了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:01,532 --> 00:18:04,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>有一条给埃尔德医生的口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:08,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>-啊？
-给医生的口信</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:09,674 --> 00:18:11,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>是给埃尔德医生的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:11,678 --> 00:18:13,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的 埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:14,392 --> 00:18:18,229
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该把这个交给他…大概吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:18,817 --> 00:18:21,319
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生 有你的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:21,990 --> 00:18:23,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:29,296 --> 00:18:31,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:31,092 --> 00:18:33,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>失礼了！在下不知道你是女孩子</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:33,972 --> 00:18:38,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你的错觉
外国人有时候会改变性别</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:42,531 --> 00:18:45,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 骗你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:46,998 --> 00:18:48,708
<c.simplifiedchinese>是有什么苦衷吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:52,426 --> 00:18:55,971
<c.simplifiedchinese>我解释给你听 请进吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:58,229 --> 00:18:59,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>（波特酒）</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:59,148 --> 00:19:01,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:01,277 --> 00:19:05,114
<c.simplifiedchinese>是个总是戴着面具遮住脸 身份不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:05,202 --> 00:19:08,872
<c.simplifiedchinese>但医术一流的流浪医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:08,958 --> 00:19:13,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一边顺应富豪名流的请求环游世界</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:13,885 --> 00:19:17,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>一边救治穷苦病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:17,559 --> 00:19:20,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以你想处理掉那个埃尔德医生吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:21,024 --> 00:19:24,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>是的 这是我的地盘</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:24,490 --> 00:19:30,746
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有冷酷地干掉妨碍我的人
才能杀鸡儆猴</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:30,836 --> 00:19:36,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过日本人杀掉外国人
可没那么容易脱身</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:37,349 --> 00:19:40,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 所以你才叫我们来</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:40,146 --> 00:19:41,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:42,317 --> 00:19:47,614
<c.simplifiedchinese>埃尔德医生身边有一个保镖
我的手下无人能敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:48,204 --> 00:19:52,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>左脸颊有十字刀疤的臭武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:52,546 --> 00:19:53,547
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:53,631 --> 00:19:55,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:55,468 --> 00:20:00,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们有一位十分渴望
与高手武士交手的剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:20:01,439 --> 00:20:04,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>有工作了 艾斯佩拉尔</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:20:05,989 --> 00:20:09,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>有十字刀疤的武士 是那时候的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:20:10,749 --> 00:20:12,125
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:20:12,210 --> 00:20:16,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>盛名远传</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:16,594 --> 00:20:20,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>海外的精通武士刀的大师</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:20,727 --> 00:20:22,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:22,439 --> 00:20:25,067
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩杀不敬之敌</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:25,152 --> 00:20:32,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了荣誉甚至愿意切腹自尽的
自尊心极高的狂战士</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:32,208 --> 00:20:37,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们在十年前明治维新后
就销声匿迹了</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:37,844 --> 00:20:44,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过抱着一线希望
我还是千里迢迢来到了这个岛国…</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:44,858 --> 00:20:47,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>只求跟武士一战</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:47,823 --> 00:20:50,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个有十字刀疤的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:50,453 --> 00:20:54,290
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来是幕末时期京都的有名剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:55,797 --> 00:20:58,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时代的幸存者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:58,093 --> 00:21:00,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>怪不得他这么厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:21:01,182 --> 00:21:03,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是你梦寐以求的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:21:05,692 --> 00:21:07,819
<c.simplifiedchinese>有十字刀疤的武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:12,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中最强的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:21:13,541 --> 00:21:15,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:22:46,685 --> 00:22:47,811
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:22:47,896 --> 00:22:51,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>《明治剑客浪漫谭 第零幕后篇》</c.simplifiedchinese>

